# Wave W17-U (Route 204): bluff sand — bluff-road pale sand: a bright pale sand running Revelry to the Ruined Path’s doors, scree-pale in its flecks (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end). Split from Route 203’s smoke-dulled coal sand by brightness: the bluff road still sees clean sky.
